WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:05.547
-Do you think we could finish by today?
-Yes, if we continue at this pace.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.465
Madam, if you would.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:10.093
Madam?

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:12.470
I'm okay.

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:16.891
Madam!

00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:20.937
-I'm okay.
-But...

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:23.815
Please, continue.

00:00:23.898 --> 00:00:26.443
-Stop! That's enough! Mommy!
-Miss Ann!

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:28.903
-That's enough!
-Ann.

00:00:30.238 --> 00:00:33.241
I'm okay.
So, please go play in the other room.

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:38.788
Why are you writing this letter?

00:00:39.247 --> 00:00:42.834
Who is it for?
Daddy isn't even with us anymore!

00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:47.380
-It's an important letter.
-It's for someone I don't know, isn't it?

00:00:47.922 --> 00:00:50.175
Someone who won't even come visit you!

00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:54.429
No one really cares about you anyway!

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:03.271
Is the letter more important than me?

00:01:06.858 --> 00:01:09.277
There's nothing more important than you.

00:01:10.612 --> 00:01:12.322
You're such a liar.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:13.531
I'm not lying.

00:01:15.366 --> 00:01:21.206
But you're not getting better at all!
You said you were going to get better!

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:22.624
That's right.

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:24.209
I already know!

00:01:24.876 --> 00:01:26.127
I...

00:01:26.711 --> 00:01:29.714
I'll be all alone once you're gone!

00:01:32.342 --> 00:01:35.428
How much longer
will I be able to be with you?

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:40.183
If I'm going to be all alone anyway,

00:01:40.308 --> 00:01:43.812
then stop writing some letter
and spend time with me now!

00:01:44.395 --> 00:01:45.814
Please, Mom!

00:01:46.397 --> 00:01:47.232
Please!

00:01:47.816 --> 00:01:49.651
-Mommy!
-Miss Ann.

00:01:50.318 --> 00:01:51.402
Mommy!

00:01:56.324 --> 00:01:57.408
Miss Ann!

